  "description": "Foundgine.Extensions contains the optional host integrations for Foundgine 3.x: Hot Chocolate GraphQL translation, the shared open-intent resolver, and the secure query and mutation executors, Temporal durable-workflow integration (outbox bridge, saga and approval workflow, operation activities and endpoints), and Keycloak identity integration (JWT validation, role and tenant mapping, short-lived signed warrants, including for Temporal workers). Third-party libraries are restored as NuGet dependencies and are not bundled as DLLs.",
